3d747e43 (Oliver Butterley 2025-06-02 20:03:32 +0200 19) /- Note for curiosity with `partialSups_succ'`: In `partialSups_succ` slightly weaker assumptions on
3d747e43 (Oliver Butterley 2025-06-02 20:03:32 +0200 20) `ι` are used: `[LinearOrder ι] [LocallyFiniteOrderBot ι] [SuccOrder ι]`. However using just this
3d747e43 (Oliver Butterley 2025-06-02 20:03:32 +0200 21) breaks the statement because it can't sythesise `[OrderBot ι]`. These assumptions permit an empty
3d747e43 (Oliver Butterley 2025-06-02 20:03:32 +0200 22) set and perhaps it can't use the hypothesis to exclude this and guarantee the existence of `⊥`.
3d747e43 (Oliver Butterley 2025-06-02 20:03:32 +0200 23) The assumptions used here match those of `partialSups_bot` in the same file. -/
3d747e43 (Oliver Butterley 2025-06-02 20:03:32 +0200 24) 
